{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "owners": [
    {
      "role": "contract-owner",
      "paths": [
        "package.json",
        "pyproject.toml",
        "*.csproj",
        "*.sln",
        "scripts/**",
        ".github/**",
        "infra/**",
        "spec/**",
        "**/migrations/**",
        "src/**"
      ],
      "exclusive": [
        "package.json",
        "pyproject.toml",
        "*.csproj",
        "*.sln",
        "scripts/**",
        ".github/**",
        "infra/**",
        "spec/**",
        "**/migrations/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "dev-worker",
      "paths": [
        "src/**",
        "assets/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "qa-worker",
      "paths": [
        "tests/**"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "这是一份通用占位。技术栈定下来后，协调器应该按真实目录结构重写 paths。",
    "paths = 该 role 可改范围；exclusive = 只有该 role 能改，跨目录也生效。",
    "构建配置、CI、契约、数据迁移放进 contract-owner 的 exclusive，避免多人同时动。",
    "骨架期 contract-owner 也能碰 src/**，但它不在 exclusive 里，所以 dev-worker 照样能写业务代码。"
  ]
}
